# Breaking strings apart: split (limits, regexes, :skip-empty, :v), comb, words, lines.

=== str-split-limit-two-destructure
from: Getopt::Long 0.4.2 lib/Getopt/Long.rakumod:95
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method split
--- code
for 'name=value=more', 'flag' -> $pair {
    my ($key, $value) = $pair.split('=', 2);
    say "$key: {$value // '(none)'}";
}
--- expect
name: value=more
flag: (none)

