=== str-split-v-keeps-newlines
from: Selkie 0.16.0 lib/Selkie/Widget/RichText.rakumod:236
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method split
--- code
my $text = "one\ntwo\nthree";
my @parts = $text.split(/\n/, :v);
say @parts.elems;
say @parts.map({ $_ ~~ Match ?? '\n' !! $_ }).join('|');
--- expect
5
one|\n|two|\n|three

=== str-split-skip-empty-hash
from: App::RaCoCo 2.0.1 lib/App/Racoco/Configuration.rakumod:137
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method split
--- code
my $line = 'a:1;;b:2;';
my %values = ($line // '').split(';', :skip-empty)
    .map(*.split(':')).map({ .[0] => .[1] });
say %values.sort.map({ "{.key}={.value}" }).join(',');
--- expect
a=1,b=2

