=== str-comb-two-hex-blob
from: Digest::SHA1::Native 1.0.1 lib/Digest/SHA1/Native.rakumod:27
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method comb
--- code
my $hex = 'de00adbeef';
my $blob = Blob.new( $hex.comb(2).map({ :16($_) }));
say $blob.elems;
say $blob.list;
--- expect
5
(222 0 173 190 239)

=== str-comb-six-bit-groups
from: HTTP::Tiny 0.2.6 lib/HTTP/Tiny.rakumod:409
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method comb
--- code
my $blob = 'Man'.encode;
my $out = $blob».fmt('%08b').join.comb(6);
