=== str-comb-regex-vowel-groups
from: Lingua::EN::Syllable 1.0.3 lib/Lingua/EN/Syllable.rakumod:57
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method comb
--- code
for <beautiful rhythm queue> -> $word {
    my $syl = $word.comb(/<[aeiouy]>+/);
